  <item>
    <title>GPT医疗的可能性与局限</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adc2048c96c8942ec1164d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adc2048c96c8942ec1164d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 03:09:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们讨论了大语言模型在医疗领域中应用的局限和可能性。我们尝试对AI的“幻觉”问题进行了一些反思，也展望了共生医学的种种可能性。我们认为大语言模型不仅可以成为医学实践的得力助手，而且还能帮助人们成为AI增强型患者。</span></p><p></p><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 大模型准确率下降的可能原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> AI“幻觉”和其他局限性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a> 关于“幻觉”的哲学反思</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1336">22:16</a> AI在疼痛医学领域里的一些应用</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> 共生医学革命</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> 医学实践的得力助手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a> AI增强型患者</span></p><p></p><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>[美] 彼得·李（Peter Lee） / [美] 凯丽·戈德伯格（Carey Goldberg） / [美] 伊萨克·科恩（Isaac Kohane）《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36407227/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36407227/"><span>超越想象的GPT医疗</span></a><span>》</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616a65bc177a486743676130/lnZwKcY0w9Z2hpkqzO2-4CddyBnk.m4a" length="59148873" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp-xSt4Ve4ZFrkpriCmA-L7CPMP.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《欢迎来龙餐馆》里的美式中餐究竟是什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab4bb97e742e36efcbab2ce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab4bb97e742e36efcbab2ce</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 06:20:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们从美式中餐的定义出发，回顾了美式中餐的历史发展脉络，并介绍了几种代表性菜品。最后，我们还讨论了美式中餐的文化影响与社会意义。</span></p><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 什么是美式中餐？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 美国人接触中餐最早的记录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="357">05:57</a> 淘金热与萌芽期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 杂碎热与普及期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">12:28</a> 一位法国医生的指控</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 王清福的反击</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1109">18:29</a> 王清福列的菜单里提到了炒杂碎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 波西米亚人与炒杂碎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 炒杂碎的起源</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 李鸿章访美与杂碎热</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1914">31:54</a> 杂碎热的原因：一种深沉的满足感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 对杂碎非中国菜的质疑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 多元化发展期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 1950年代末中餐馆经营惨淡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 《排华法案》的终结</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2274">37:54</a> 杨步伟的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2539">42:19</a> 北平饭店和约翰尼·钱的餐厅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">43:24</a> 福禄寿餐厅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 1972年尼克松访华掀起新一轮中餐热潮</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2781">46:21</a> 美式中餐的连锁化与商业化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3075">51:15</a> 美式中餐的核心特征与与中国菜的差异</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3123">52:03</a> 左宗棠鸡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3363">56:03</a> 橘子鸡和芝麻鸡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3482">58:02</a> 木须肉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3711">1:01:51</a> 芙蓉蛋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3889">1:04:49</a> 蒙古牛肉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3995">1:06:35</a> 炸蟹角（Crab Rangoon）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4058">1:07:38</a> 蛋卷（egg roll）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4148">1:09:08</a> 幸运饼干（Fortune Cookie）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4322">1:12:02</a> 文化影响与社会意义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4433">1:13:53</a> 美式中餐的发展史本质上是一部华人移民的奋斗史</span></p><p></p><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>[美]安德鲁·科伊《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26680436/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26680436/"><span>来份杂碎：中餐在美国的文化史</span></a><span>》</span></p></li><li><p><span>[清]红杏主人 《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/25847126/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/25847126/"><span>粤菜第一书:美味求真</span></a><span>》 </span></p></li><li><p><span>[美]M.F.K.费雪 《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35200361/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35200361/"><span>如何煮狼</span></a><span>》</span></p></li><li><p><span>[美]詹妮弗·李《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/25315047/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/25315047/"><span>幸运签饼纪事</span></a><span>》</span></p></li></ul><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>Liam Gallagher 《Chinatown》</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616a65bc177a486743676130/lnAhyHrlH7RN59kE9bgtMUeKJveM.m4a" length="76116412" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp-xSt4Ve4ZFrkpriCmA-L7CPMP.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>真的猛士，敢于直面自己的体检报告</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8a8bd9ef65145dfcc3de46</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8a8bd9ef65145dfcc3de46</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 06:08:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们讨论了体检项目的选择、体检前的准备、体验报告的解读等问题。另外，我们还涉及了体检可能存在的一些负面影响。</span></p><p></p><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="21">00:21</a> 体检的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 体检应该做哪些项目？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> 体检前的准备</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 好的体检应该是什么样的?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a> 为什么公立医院体检那么贵?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 需要向体检医生交代哪些既往史、生活史、家族史？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 体检报告看不懂怎么办？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 肝功能、肾功能、甲状腺功能指标怎么看？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 尿常规中的蛋白尿和潜血是不是肾脏问题？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a> 对结节、囊肿、斑块、息肉、结石感到焦虑怎么办？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> 脂肪肝能痊愈吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">38:11</a> 体检的一些负面影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2934">48:54</a> “重要的不是治愈，而是带着病痛活下去”</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616a65bc177a486743676130/lvjLsQulfvb20FZWRj5ScaIl64XO.m4a" length="49102897" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp-xSt4Ve4ZFrkpriCmA-L7CPMP.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从“量化自我”到“均值人”可穿戴设备的历史、原理、反思与争议</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a658021a3fec224d5a362ae</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a658021a3fec224d5a362ae</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 03:52:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目介绍了可穿戴设备的发展历程、工作原理以及一些反思和争议。</span></p><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="114">01:54</a> 可穿戴设备的发展历程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> 可穿戴设备的原理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2117">35:17</a> 量化生活（Quantified Self）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a> 可穿戴设备定位尴尬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 可穿戴设备带来的“数值困扰”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2716">45:16</a> 量化自我是一种自我追踪与自我规训</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqR5-EAcmLR2vwwN24iLzdO7CT5N.png"><p><span>算盘戒指</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVdZtF_v7GCDHjp06Wpmwcu-3Xh.png"><p><span>Pulsar（脉冲星）计算器手表</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo6xpa5rq5dquncQ-z6ot-sKYyy9.png"><p><span>电视腕表Seiko TV Watch</span></p><p></p><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><ul><li><p><a href="https://www.swissinfo.ch/chi/%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0/%E6%AD%A5%E6%95%B0%E3%80%81%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8E%E7%9D%A1%E7%9C%A0%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E7%A9%BF%E6%88%B4%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%EF%BC%9F/90700800" data-url="https://www.swissinfo.ch/chi/%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0/%E6%AD%A5%E6%95%B0%E3%80%81%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B%E4%B8%8E%E7%9D%A1%E7%9C%A0%EF%BC%9A%E5%8F%AF%E7%A9%BF%E6%88%B4%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E6%B5%8B%E9%87%8F%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%EF%BC%9F/90700800"><span>步数、压力与睡眠：可穿戴设备还能测量什么？</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://paper.people.com.cn/jksb/html/2015-05/25/content_1572734.htm" data-url="https://paper.people.com.cn/jksb/html/2015-05/25/content_1572734.htm"><span>可穿戴健康设备的是是非非</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.zgjssw.gov.cn/yaowen/202312/t20231222_8176291.shtml" data-url="https://www.zgjssw.gov.cn/yaowen/202312/t20231222_8176291.shtml"><span>智能可穿戴设备给生活带来便捷也带来“数值困扰”</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://www.cssn.cn/xwcbx/__deleted_2022.12.31_13.46.18__xwcbx_xkqy/202208/t20220802_5440132.shtml" data-url="https://www.cssn.cn/xwcbx/__deleted_2022.12.31_13.46.18__xwcbx_xkqy/202208/t20220802_5440132.shtml"><span>作为媒介的可穿戴设备：身体的数据化与规训</span></a></p></li></ul><p></p><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><ul><li><p><span>张楚 《老张》</span></p></li><li><p><span>范晓萱,杨峻荣 《健康歌》</span></p></li></ul><p></p>]]></description>
