  <item>
    <title>《我的脑子不转了》：如何治愈“忙碌大脑”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a222756b30e1571aea0e543</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a222756b30e1571aea0e543</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 01:42:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们介绍了一本书，书名是《我的脑子不转了》，副标题是：“脑科医师的8周大脑清理计划”。这本书提出了治疗“忙碌大脑综合症”的方法。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">2:19</a> 压力的分类和“压力-成功循环”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">4:08</a> 压力导致忙碌大脑的迹象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">7:52</a> 忙碌大脑疗法：方法因人而异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 如何治愈忙碌大脑</span></p><span></span><p><span>大脑转变法(SHIFT)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> 睡眠与忙碌大脑的昼夜节律（Sleep）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> 忙碌大脑中的激素（Hormone）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a> 忙碌大脑中的炎症、糖分和咖啡因（Inflammation）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 忙碌大脑的燃料：食物和脂肪（Food）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1811">30:11</a> 科技产品与忙碌大脑（Techology）</span></p><span></span><p><span>8周大脑转变计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> 第1周：设定目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a> 第2周：7天睡眠挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> 第3周：数字戒瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">43:24</a> 第4周：大脑暂停练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a> 第5周：用生物学技巧摄取营养</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">47:56</a> 第6周：燃料、能量和专注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a> 第7周：超级大脑超级激素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">49:35</a> 第8周：通盘考量</span></p><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>[美]罗米·穆什塔克 《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/38226166/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/38226166/"><span>我的脑子不转了</span></a><span>》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>花儿乐队 《静止》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>清醒乐队 《好极了！？》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616a65bc177a486743676130/lgW8YsyHwkeIZT-CYrgFuVxnxfRl.m4a" length="53476974" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp-xSt4Ve4ZFrkpriCmA-L7CPMP.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>生命延续、回春、长生不老与人类增强技术</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ffff8c1b7bd50295d604e6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ffff8c1b7bd50295d604e6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 May 2026 03:55:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目首先辨析了生命延续（Life extension）、回春（Rejuvenation）、长生不老（Immortality）、生命暂停（Suspended animation）、人类增强（Human enhancement）等概念，然后介绍了实现永生的几种可能的技术路径和相关研究。最后介绍了一本书《超越百岁》。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">1:14</a> 器官移植、长生不老和人类预期寿命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">3:27</a> 生命延续（Life extension）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">5:51</a> 回春（Rejuvenation）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 长生不老（Immortality）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 生命暂停（Suspended animation）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a> 人类增强（Human enhancement）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 抗衰老运动（Anti-aging movement）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 再生医学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> 纳米医学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a> 线粒体移植</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 抗老化药物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 道恩灯塔水母</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">36:42</a> 关于植物寿命的研究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 意识上传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">43:44</a> Unity Biotechnology</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a> Calico Labs</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2884">48:04</a> Altos Labs</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a> 《超越百岁》长寿的科学与艺术</span></p><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MP6Zy5sGQlMdveFcKvRLJA " data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MP6Zy5sGQlMdveFcKvRLJA "><span>提取26岁孙女细胞！活至122岁！91岁物理学家线粒体移植I期试验完成，代价只要5万美元？</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-FYMu17fCfu8NTCPpKIcLw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-FYMu17fCfu8NTCPpKIcLw"><span>一种水母的基因揭示永生之秘诀</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.cas.cn/xzfc/202209/t20220927_4848928.shtml" data-url="https://www.cas.cn/xzfc/202209/t20220927_4848928.shtml"><span>王佳伟：草木间探索“无用之用”</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.mg21.com/ubx.html" data-url="https://www.mg21.com/ubx.html"><span>生物制药公司：联合生物科技Unity Biotechnology(UBX)</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1974074210499452954" data-url="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1974074210499452954"><span>百亿资金打水漂！谷歌的AI抗衰公司，成了艾伯维的弃子</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/68pHYwZwNqnYRluib4-7PA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/68pHYwZwNqnYRluib4-7PA"><span>硅谷增长最快的独角兽找到了人类“长生不老药”？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>彼得·阿提亚、 比尔·吉福德《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36696538/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36696538/"><span>超越百岁</span></a><span>》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期歌单</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Oasis 《Live Forever》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Bob Dylan 《Forever Young (Slow Version)》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616a65bc177a486743676130/lmoq8oj6Ivut4LhSA08ngvt2CIqg.m4a" length="59701713" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp-xSt4Ve4ZFrkpriCmA-L7CPMP.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
