  <item>
    <title>邪修减肥法大全</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c8ebf7e2c8be3155ca827e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c8ebf7e2c8be3155ca827e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 09:27:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们罗列了各种邪修减肥法，大致可分为“管住嘴”、“迈开腿”等几类。其中有些是有科学依据的，有些是不推荐的。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span>管住嘴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">2:07</a> 跟领导一起吃饭、吃饭时别开空调、餐桌上放面镜子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">4:39</a> 精致妆+白衣、穿合身外套</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">6:01</a> 餐具换小的、蓝色餐具法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">8:03</a> 多看冷色调的食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">9:20</a> 把食物平铺开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 自我暗示法、身份扮演法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 换算热量法、换手吃饭、专注进食法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 先喝汤和吃菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 刷牙止馋、多闻薄荷油、嚼口香糖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1095">18:15</a> 喝水闹钟、碳水冷藏复热法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 碳水减肥法、高钾+排水饮食法、鸡蛋咖啡玉米餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 液断减肥法、三伏天极端断食法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a> 心理操控法、偏门物理干预法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 燃脂咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a> 左旋肉碱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2193">36:33</a> 减肥酵素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 燃脂片(fat burner)</span></p><span></span><p><span>迈开腿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a> 干点家务</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2807">46:47</a> 手机放远点、站着回消息、唱歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>其他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a> 把减肥 flag 焊死在朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a> 瘦者不入爱河，减肥先分了再说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">50:25</a> 东方古国传统方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3105">51:45</a> 西方奇闻异术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3327">55:27</a> 针灸、拔罐、点穴、经络刷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3446">57:26</a> 冷冻溶脂（Cool Sculpting）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3617">1:00:17</a> 吸脂手术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3713">1:01:53</a> 可持续减肥，减肥的尽头是提升代谢</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYmnwTBrKrbpXp544wxI_SWhPz3.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1948485451204765216" data-url="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1948485451204765216"><span>邪修减肥法爆火！10个亲测有效，4个千万别试</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.kedo.net.cn/yclm/qwbk/202508/t20250811_146674.html " data-url="https://www.kedo.net.cn/yclm/qwbk/202508/t20250811_146674.html "><span>13 个邪修减肥法，不用节食也不用运动</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://post.smzdm.com/p/a3r9r3xd/ " data-url="https://post.smzdm.com/p/a3r9r3xd/ "><span>10个邪修减肥法，不折磨但超掉秤，懒人必看</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>国家卫生健康委办公厅《</span><a href="https://www.nhc.gov.cn/sps/c100088/202402/9ba512ba8e314a47a181db11d2fa188d/files/1743476136267_20714.pdf" data-url="https://www.nhc.gov.cn/sps/c100088/202402/9ba512ba8e314a47a181db11d2fa188d/files/1743476136267_20714.pdf"><span>成人肥胖食养指南</span></a><span>》&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>火箭少女101 《卡路里》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>郭富城 《动起来》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/616a65bc177a486743676130/lhOdlNu9OGlRaRAmbWqsiuGk0bu2.m4a" length="65085166" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgp-xSt4Ve4ZFrkpriCmA-L7CPMP.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>减肥针、美白丸、“聪明药”，各种网红神药大盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699bb245de29766da93239a6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699bb245de29766da93239a6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 02:02:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们盘点了多种网红药物，包括减肥、美白、护眼、流感、抗衰老、聪明药、考试冷静药等。最后我们还列举了一些涉毒“网红药”。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span>减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">2:28</a> 利拉鲁肽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="469">7:49</a> 司美格鲁肽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a> 替尔泊肽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 玛仕度肽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 瑞他鲁肽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1289">21:29</a> 奥利司他</span></p><span></span><p><span>美白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 氨甲环酸&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 谷胱甘肽</span></p><span></span><p><span>护眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a> 阿托品眼药水</span></p><span></span><p><span>流感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a> 奥司他韦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> 玛巴洛沙韦</span></p><span></span><p><span>抗衰老</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2515">41:55</a> 二甲双胍</span></p><span></span><p><span>聪明药、考试冷静药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 利他林、专注达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3430">57:10</a> 盐酸普萘洛尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3722">1:02:02</a> 涉毒网红药</span></p><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://yjj.sh.gov.cn/ybs/20230609/a90dfe2af59d49b1bc9bf9698c7e03a7.html" data-url="https://yjj.sh.gov.cn/ybs/20230609/a90dfe2af59d49b1bc9bf9698c7e03a7.html"><span>“夏天来了，肉肉藏不住了”——使用网红药减肥还是悠着点</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.news.cn/fortune/20251209/d1dc1abddde84355af46cded7d9df497/c.html" data-url="https://www.news.cn/fortune/20251209/d1dc1abddde84355af46cded7d9df497/c.html"><span>新华调查丨减肥药、美白丸、护眼“神水”……“网红药”靠谱吗？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://yjj.gansu.gov.cn/yjj/c114616/202304/169826487.shtml" data-url="https://yjj.gansu.gov.cn/yjj/c114616/202304/169826487.shtml"><span>网红减肥药「奥利司他」，真的有效吗？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.gzsys.org.cn/article/16363" data-url="https://www.gzsys.org.cn/article/16363"><span>网红美容保健品“美白丸”，究竟是“何方神圣”？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.med.cuhk.edu.hk/tc/press-releases/cuhk-world-s-first-study-proves-myopia-in-children-can-be-prevented-by-low-concentration-atropine-eyedrops" data-url="https://www.med.cuhk.edu.hk/tc/press-releases/cuhk-world-s-first-study-proves-myopia-in-children-can-be-prevented-by-low-concentration-atropine-eyedrops"><span>中大全球首證低濃度阿托品眼藥水可預防兒童近視</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.hast.net.cn/2025/12-12/120329.html" data-url="https://www.hast.net.cn/2025/12-12/120329.html"><span>把奥司他韦当“流感神药”，一发烧就吃它？医生提醒注意这几点</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.whsdhyy.com/wap/news_list.aspx?channel_id=7&amp;classid=61&amp;id=7415" data-url="https://www.whsdhyy.com/wap/news_list.aspx?channel_id=7&amp;classid=61&amp;id=7415"><span>“神药”玛巴络沙韦走红，药师提醒：不要盲目使用！</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>让部分考生成瘾的“聪明药”,什么来头</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.chinanews.com.cn/m/sh/2025/08-14/10464582.shtml" data-url="https://www.chinanews.com.cn/m/sh/2025/08-14/10464582.shtml"><span>高血压处方药竟成网红“考试冷静药”</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://chengmai.hainan.gov.cn/chengmai/gongan/202410/1fa1b81e690e40c1b6f65c2e51b931ec.shtml" data-url="https://chengmai.hainan.gov.cn/chengmai/gongan/202410/1fa1b81e690e40c1b6f65c2e51b931ec.shtml"><span>揭开“网红减肥药”涉毒真相</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>乐正绫 《药》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Poison 《Every Rose Has Its Thorn》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
