    <title>赛博玄学、AI算命与情绪消费</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696218cce235ea65bc1a13c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696218cce235ea65bc1a13c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 09:28:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们从传统的“五术”中的命、卜、相出发，回顾了赛博玄学的前世今生。此外，我们还讨论了年轻人热衷玄学的原因。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">2:04</a> 五术中的命、卜、相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">7:19</a> 紫微斗数开源软件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="562">9:22</a> 梅花易数Java代码解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a> 巴纳姆效应和弗拉实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 算命网站和门户网站的星座运势频道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> Web 2.0时代的赛博玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 玄学赛道上的互联网买卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 测测与泛心理赛道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> 玄学+直播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 玄学+电商</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">36:42</a> 玄学联名火出圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2341">39:01</a> 玄学消费场景空间带来情绪价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">40:43</a> 互联网公司与玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> DeepSeek如何成为中国青年的“赛博算命师”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 玄学出海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">49:09</a> 水晶饰品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a> 玄学出海的背后，离不开一个关键推手：TikTok</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3396">56:36</a> 年轻人热衷玄学的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>象棋占卜卦象</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FltoeNISb1ztcNVBNks7PdwvYGsS.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://github.com/sylarlong/iztro " data-url="https://github.com/sylarlong/iztro "><span>紫微斗数开源软件iztro</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://cloud.tencent.cn/developer/article/2530642?policyId=1004 " data-url="https://cloud.tencent.cn/developer/article/2530642?policyId=1004 "><span>梅花易数的Java实现</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/860425.html" data-url="https://www.digitaling.com/articles/860425.html"><span>电子木鱼爆火，赛博玄学真令人上头？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/17961352552" data-url="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/17961352552"><span>“心诚则灵”与“科技赋能”：赛博玄学如何俘获年轻人心</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://m.cyzone.cn/article/523300.html" data-url="https://m.cyzone.cn/article/523300.html"><span>玄学赛道上的互联网买卖</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20250310A048B600?suid=&amp;media_id=" data-url="https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20250310A048B600?suid=&amp;media_id="><span>AI占卜爆火：年轻人的赛博算命到底准不准？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20250919A07K2W00" data-url="https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20250919A07K2W00"><span>老外也信风水？第一批靠玄学出海的中国人已经赚翻了</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/1625438.html" data-url="https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/1625438.html"><span>情绪价值赛道，冲出一匹黑马</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>誓言 《求佛》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>陈小春 《没那种命》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
