  <item>
    <title>大郎，该吃“仿制药”了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693e323237f52a644ecf74a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693e323237f52a644ecf74a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Dec 2025 03:55:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们辨析了专利药、品牌药、原研药与仿制药的概念；简要回顾了现代制药业简史以及美国、印度、中国仿制药的发展；还介绍了一致性评价以及仿制药的部分“真相”。最后，我们探讨了普通人能做什么。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">2:21</a> 专利药、品牌药、原研药与仿制药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 现代制药业简史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 美国仿制药的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> 《科夫沃-哈里斯修正案》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 《Hatch-Waxman法案》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2614">43:34</a> 印度仿制药的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3235">53:55</a> 中国仿制药的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">55:17</a> 一致性评价是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3700">1:01:40</a> 为什么仿制药与原研药会不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4173">1:09:33</a> 药品集采制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4382">1:13:02</a> 《仿制药的真相》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4627">1:17:07</a> 格列卫的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4947">1:22:27</a> 适当调整剂量，定期复查！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://bydrug.pharmcube.com/news/detail/c56cbbf95159767766ff03fa456dd3e9" data-url="https://bydrug.pharmcube.com/news/detail/c56cbbf95159767766ff03fa456dd3e9"><span>原研药概念是时候退出中国了！</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.phirda.com/artilce_14889.html?cId=1" data-url="https://www.phirda.com/artilce_14889.html?cId=1"><span>“原研药”概念为何中国独有？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://sciiip.gdufs.edu.cn/info/1026/1611.htm" data-url="https://sciiip.gdufs.edu.cn/info/1026/1611.htm"><span>我国药品专利期限补偿制度的构建</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.nmpa.gov.cn/zhuanti/ypqxgg/ggzhcfg/20150818101201640.html?type=pc&amp;m=" data-url="https://www.nmpa.gov.cn/zhuanti/ypqxgg/ggzhcfg/20150818101201640.html?type=pc&amp;m="><span>国务院关于改革药品医疗器械审评审批制度的意见</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://pharm.jgvogel.cn/c/1187/1187494.shtml" data-url="https://pharm.jgvogel.cn/c/1187/1187494.shtml"><span>从染料开始！让我们一起纵观历史，了解现代制药行业的起源</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://wap.china-pharmacy.com/attached/wenjian/1/201603/10160938_6946.pdf" data-url="https://wap.china-pharmacy.com/attached/wenjian/1/201603/10160938_6946.pdf"><span>中美两国药品安全监管体制的比较研究</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://m.cnpharm.com/c/2018-09-05/498880.shtml" data-url="https://m.cnpharm.com/c/2018-09-05/498880.shtml"><span>美国是如何发展仿制药的——美国药品审评创仿平衡机制研究</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="http://www.zclawyer.com/news_details/1747068651764609024.html" data-url="http://www.zclawyer.com/news_details/1747068651764609024.html"><span>药品专利链接制度研究</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.hk01.com/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%B0%88%E9%A1%8C/853682/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6-%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%97%A5%E6%88%BF%E6%98%AF%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%85%89%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84" data-url="https://www.hk01.com/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E5%B0%88%E9%A1%8C/853682/%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6-%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E8%97%A5%E6%88%BF%E6%98%AF%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%85%89%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84"><span>印度，世界藥房是如何煉成的</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://news.163.com/special/reviews/genericindia0215.html" data-url="https://news.163.com/special/reviews/genericindia0215.html"><span>印度：专注仿制药四十五年</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>【美】凯瑟琳·埃班《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35219823/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35219823/"><span>仿制药的真相</span></a><span>》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>郭玲 《大郎该吃药了(DJ何鹏版)》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>周杰伦 《本草纲目》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
