    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Nov 2025 09:14:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目邀请到了在北京和厦门两地生活的文森特老师，和我们一起聊了聊北京人在其他城市生活的感受。主播无觅也分享了自己在深圳的生活经历。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">5:08</a> 身份认同与归属</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 生活节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> 选择与平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 此与彼的便利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">27:34</a> 情感的锚点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 文化的穿梭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">39:58</a> 家的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 挑战与代价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3695">1:01:35</a> 未来的画卷</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>刘欢 《千万次的问》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Lady Gaga 《Gypsy》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
