    <title>在“觉照”中点亮人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68df546d8e321a0d6fc502fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68df546d8e321a0d6fc502fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Oct 2025 04:46:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们从脑雾（Brain rot）现象出发，介绍了《觉照》这本书提供的12种重获专注力的工具。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">3:51</a> 《觉照》的作者杰夫·卡普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">5:05</a> 打开内心的开关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">8:11</a> 带着问题而活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 该困扰时就困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 做一个主动的机会主义者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">19:03</a> 对你的脑子掐一把</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">21:53</a> 迷上运动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> 勤于练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> 做新的事，做不一样的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 拥抱从失败中涌现的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a> 保持谦卑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2564">42:44</a> 按下“暂停”键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a> 拥抱自然</span></p><span></span><h2><span>参考资料</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>[美] 杰夫·卡普《觉照》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>孙燕姿 《绿光》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>张雨生 《灵光》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
