  <item>
    <title>程序员和医生工作中的委屈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b409295faf3686594553d9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b409295faf3686594553d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 08:37:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们从委屈这个词的含义出发，讨论了医生和程序员工作中可能遇到的种种不公正的待遇。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主要内容</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">1:43</a> 委屈这个词的含义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> 德瓦尔的卷尾猴实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">4:01</a> 卷尾实验和喝水实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">6:56</a> 工作内容被误解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a> 不合理的工期和需求变更</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 医学的局限性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 被过度期望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="889">14:49</a> 职业发展受限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 35岁问题（ageism）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 技术更新迅速带来的压力和疲惫感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> 工作压力巨大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a> 外界对程序员的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 医生的态度问题和投诉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a> 加班和内卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 医保政策带来的压力</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期歌单</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>周传雄 《委屈》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>张惠妹 《哭不出来》</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
